B.Rv=s(["I wear a moon on my stony face. / Find me! I'm in a sleepy place.","My moon comes out at night to play. / Find my stone, and shout hooray!"],t.s)
B.Oy=s(["I wear a sun with pointy rays. / It shines on me on sunny days.","My sun is round and very bright. / Find my stone. It shines with light!"],t.s)
B.O_=s(["My leaf fell down from a tree. / Find my stone. Come look at me!","I wear a leaf with a tiny stem. / Trees have lots. I have one of them!"],t.s)
B.P4=s(["My fish can swim, but not today. / It's on a stone! Hip, hip, hooray!","Blub, blub! I have a fish with fins. / Find my stone, and the fun begins!"],t.s)
B.R9=s(["I wear a crown, like a king or queen. / I'm the fanciest stone you've seen!","A crown with points, one, two, three. / Bow to the king! Then look at me!"],t.s)
B.PI=s(["I wear a heart, for hugs and love. / Find my stone. Look down, not above!","My heart says, I love you so! / Find my stone, and say hello!"],t.s)
B.NT=s(["I wear a key. It opens doors. / Click, click! Is this one yours?","My key is long, with a round top. / Find my stone, then hop, hop, hop!"],t.s)
B.Qq=s(["I wear a cloud, all puffy and round. / A sky picture, down on the ground!","My cloud makes rain. Drip, drop, drip! / Find my stone. Then hop and skip!"],t.s)
